{"id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-subalgebra.md","title":"Subalgebra","display":"df-subalgebra — Subalgebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-subalgebra","aliases":["93-df-subalgebra"],"display":"df-subalgebra — Subalgebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-subalgebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-subalgebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subalgebra — Subalgebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> are algebra candidates; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-recovering subalgebra predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\mathfrak B|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\bigl(f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\bar b)=f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\mathfrak B|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\bigl(f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\bar b)=f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak B}\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak B}\\)</span> already has codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>, equality with the restriction of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> supplies closure. The quantified similarity type is common to both structures, and nullary operations are covered as well.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ are algebra candidates; $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-algebra]] and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ are algebra candidates; $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-algebra]] and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&\\land|\\mathfrak B|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\bigl(f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\bar b)=f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f^{\\mathfrak B}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\mathfrak A}","display":false}],"bytes":1297,"backlinks":[{"id":"47e441115dc87ddf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ is the subalgebra predicate of [[93-df-subalgebra]]."},{"id":"40368e43da5f58fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Con}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subalgebra]] and [[93-df-congruence]]."},{"id":"18afee354a7c01b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abb649d488373612","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathsf{BA}}$, $\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-boolalg]], [[93-df-boolean-algebra]], and [[93-df-subalgebra]]."},{"id":"803e6b0ea3bd8453","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad6be0d5d62b418a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1d8f97525e56da1b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-subalgebra]] and [[93-df-powers]]."},{"id":"a8c17e59e6ab2d52","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6fd74a4291b286e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"47b7e4c7fc398110","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76e10515cb8d0501","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-subalgebra]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-subalgebra]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","ee84